title: "RC-000002-RIS-MO: Four-map affine IFS with a solid triangular attractor"
authors:
  - family-names: "Duymt"
    given-names: "S.S."
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
abstract: >-
  A Research Capital unit containing a direct proof and Lean 4 formalization
  of the unique nonempty compact invariant set of four prescribed affine maps.
  The set is the solid triangle with vertices (0,0), (1,-1), and (0,-1).
  Local verification succeeded; novelty and public publication are not asserted.
keywords:
  - iterated function systems
  - affine maps
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - triangular attractor
